OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who filmed her teenage son
OL,4,Arioting sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother-of-six who recorded her
OL,7,Fteenage son rioting in the Broadway
OL,8,Farea of Belfast avoided an immediate
OL,9,Fprison sentence on Thursday.
OL,11,FThe woman, 49, was handed a 12-month
OL,12,Fsentence, which was suspended for three
OL,13,Fyears, for a charge of cruelty to a
OL,14,Fchild.
OL,16,FJudge Laura Ievers KC said the disorder
OL,17,Fhad a "significant impact on police and
OL,18,Ftheir resources, and on members of the
OL,19,Fcommunity both directly and
OL,20,Findirectly".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
